9.0             | 2024-05-10T00:06:00.000Z | staging
14.0            | 2024-05-10T00:08:00.000Z | prod
27.0            | 2024-05-10T00:08:00.000Z | qa
14.0            | 2024-05-10T00:08:00.000Z | staging
23.0            | 2024-05-10T00:10:00.000Z | prod
